{"4700550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Handwalk", "steam_appid": 4700550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4887060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handwalk</strong> is a difficult physics-based 3D <strong>rage game</strong> where you help a bald man reach the peak of a mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem? He can only walk on his hands, and you are the one controlling them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how do you handwalk?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It is simple:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Lift one hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Move the hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Put the hand down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the same with the other hand and... <strong>Congratulations</strong>, you are walking on your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/21f234130742731f2fdf4fd751c33917.poster.avif?t=1787183304\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/21f234130742731f2fdf4fd751c33917.webm?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/21f234130742731f2fdf4fd751c33917.mp4?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/6e98b192ad1f8a17e22ba6dd1269463e.poster.avif?t=1787183304\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/6e98b192ad1f8a17e22ba6dd1269463e.webm?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/6e98b192ad1f8a17e22ba6dd1269463e.mp4?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if handwalking is so simple, why is it so difficult?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To lift and move one hand, you need to stand only on the other. That is not easy, because the hand you are standing on starts to get tired. Standing with your hands too far apart also drains both hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one of your hands gets completely tired, <strong>you fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simply put:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>do not stand on one hand or keep your hands too wide for too long.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/fb994c1be37c4501ced7dcda4a9963e8.poster.avif?t=1787183304\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/fb994c1be37c4501ced7dcda4a9963e8.webm?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/fb994c1be37c4501ced7dcda4a9963e8.mp4?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/a45789319dda46709d005c504d3321fd.poster.avif?t=1787183304\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700550/extras/a45789319dda46709d005c504d3321fd.webm?t=1787183304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/